ence  which helped produce this play featuring  gretchev's story  has just been labelled a foreign agent  because even as civil society tries to  look forward  russia has a leadership which looks back  and without a systematic response to the  problem of domestic violence  from parliament to the courts to the  police russia's women will continue to  die  dynamagne sky news camerova russia  you
 

